## Configuration

### Claude Desktop / Claude Code

Add in Settings > Connectors > Add custom connector:
- URL: `https://{{SERVICE_NAME}}-mcp.{{DOMAIN}}/mcp`
- Click Connect → approve → sign in with Google

### Google Cloud Console Setup

1. Go to `console.cloud.google.com`
2. Create/select project
3. APIs & Services > OAuth consent screen → User Type: **Internal**
4. APIs & Services > Credentials → Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application)
5. Authorized redirect URI: `https://{{SERVICE_NAME}}-mcp.{{DOMAIN}}/callback`

